			"notes": "# Cubium Release v1.0.2\n\n**Features**\n- Added a button to the confirm screen, if it contains something Cubium can open\n\n**Fixes**\n- Fixed wrong URL in the `wiki` command\n\n---\n\n### TMYK\nStarting with this version, Cubium works together with TMYK, allowing you to browse the wiki easily using `/wiki`. You can get TMYK [here](https://www.modrinth.com/plugin/tmyk).\n\n---\n\n**Full Changelog**: [here](https://github.com/HenriTom/Cubium/compare/1.0.1...1.0.2)"
